  <div class="container split-layout">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p><h2 id="purpose-title">Better experiences enable better scientific discovery.</h2></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>This community hub was established based on the professional training and long-term experiences of user experience (UX) professionals in scientific environments.</p><p>UX in Science was founded by <a href="https://drewpaine.net" target="_blank">Drew Paine, PhD</a> during his 2026 Better Scientific Software (BSSw) <a href="https://bssw.io/blog_posts/introducing-the-2026-bssw-fellows" target="_blank">Fellowship</a> to democractize UX knowledge curated for the unique complexities of scientific software ecosystems. The BSSw Fellowship Program is supported by the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE, via the Office of Advanced Scientific Computing Research and the National Nuclear Security Administration's Advanced Simulation and Computing Program) and the National Science Foundation (NSF)</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

