      <article class="content-card"><p class="card-number">01</p><h3>Curated environment</h3><p> for scientific software communities (such as <a href="https://bssw.io" target="_blank">BSSw</a> and <a href="https://us-rse.org" target="_blank">US-RSE</a>) to rely on for a range of trusted user experience knowledge.</p></article>
      <article class="content-card"><p class="card-number">02</p><h3>Welcoming space</h3><p>to help community groups and teams share their efforts and outputs.</p></article>
